{
  "id": "6a813022e8536f1d5005ccda",
  "title": "公正な文化",
  "created": 1786851366,
  "updated": 1789702586,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a813022e8536f1d5005ccda",
      "text": "公正な文化",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851366,
      "updated": 1787992420
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaca63e0000000000daa662",
      "text": " [ヒューマンエラー]や[失敗]が起きたとき、個人を不当に責めるのではなく、組織全体で原因を究明し、安全と改善を最優先にする考え方のこと",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789699646,
      "updated": 1789699676
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81303d0000000000443d9c",
      "text": " 規則を守る",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851389,
      "updated": 1786851396
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81303e0000000000443d9d",
      "text": "  規則違反は、例外なく処罰される文化。 ",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851390,
      "updated": 1786851404
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81304c0000000000443da0",
      "text": "  一方で、故意でないエラーに対しては寛容という面も併せ持つ。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851404,
      "updated": 1786851404
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81303e0000000000443d9f",
      "text": " 公正さが失われると、大抵の人は、規則を守らなくなる。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851390,
      "updated": 1786851407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8130260000000000443d99",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851366,
      "updated": 1786851366
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8130260000000000443d9a",
      "text": "just culture",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851366,
      "updated": 1786851367
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8130270000000000443d9b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851367,
      "updated": 1786851367
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92995a00000000007986f7",
      "text": "正義の文化",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787992411,
      "updated": 1787992412
    },
    {
      "id": "6aacb0990000000000daa67b",
      "text": "フェアな文化",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789702297,
      "updated": 1789702308
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92995b00000000007986f8",
      "text": "開放性（オープンさ）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787992412,
      "updated": 1787992463
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92998100000000007986f9",
      "text": "[法令遵守]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787992449,
      "updated": 1787992469
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92998100000000007986fa",
      "text": "批判的な自己点検",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787992449,
      "updated": 1787992476
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92998100000000007986fb",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787992449,
      "updated": 1787992449
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaca6720000000000daa665",
      "text": "対義語",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789699698,
      "updated": 1789699740
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaca69b0000000000daa666",
      "text": " [非難の文化]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789699740,
      "updated": 1789699740
    },
    {
      "id": "6aacb0920000000000daa67a",
      "text": " [不公正な文化]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789702291,
      "updated": 1789702295
    },
    {
      "id": "6aacb1b20000000000daa681",
      "text": " [無責任な文化]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789702578,
      "updated": 1789702586
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaca6680000000000daa664",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789699689,
      "updated": 1789699689
    }
  ]
}